{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-06-02 13:47:00', 'title': 'AMZN LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES AMAZON.COM, INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN AMAZON.COM, INC. ("AMAZON" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: AMZN) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF AMAZON INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD BETWEEN FEBRUARY 1, 2019 AND APRIL 5, 2022.'}